{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Visiting Grandma&quot;, you step into the shoes of a grandson who arrives at his grandmother's house for a cozy stay. The eerie silence of the countryside is broken only by the creaking of the old wooden floors and the distant howling of the wind. As you explore the dimly lit rooms of her old home, your grandmother begins to reveal the creepy story of her sister, Eliza.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/d8fe896a3202705fa55622c1ec1b2065.poster.avif?t=1774393213\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/d8fe896a3202705fa55622c1ec1b2065.webm?t=1774393213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a warm and welcoming stay at grandma's house soon reveals a tragic story. Your grandmother recounts the love story that her sister, Eliza, couldn't handle. The action takes off as you visit Eliza's lover's house and the mental hospital from the perspective of her lover. Every corner of these places holds secrets, and every shadow seems to whisper a warning. The deeper you delve into the story, the more you uncover the dark history of Eliza and the sinister forces that lurk within the walls of each location. With each revelation you uncover, the line between reality and nightmare blurs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average time to complete the game: 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/168483f751336bf11c4cd328c0883ddb.poster.avif?t=1774393213\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/168483f751336bf11c4cd328c0883ddb.webm?t=1774393213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting Grandma is a first-person horror game that creates a spooky atmosphere. The game has a walking simulator and psychological horror genre elements. The action develops quickly and engages players from the beginning. Players solve mild puzzles, search for items and complete various objectives. They explore different environments: grandma's house, doctor's house, mental hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/15044bf5611e124faa17ba79a21e002a.poster.avif?t=1774393213\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/extras/15044bf5611e124faa17ba79a21e002a.webm?t=1774393213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073230?t=1774393213","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4073230?t=1774393213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/3ba644a47dde0c048f2cbe2bd36af28991e3eeac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774393213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073230/3ba644a47dde0c048f2cbe2bd36af28991e3eeac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774393213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Visiting Grandma&quot;, you step into the shoes of a grandson who arrives at his grandmother's house for a cozy stay. The eerie sil